	"transcription": [
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:00,000",
				"to": "00:00:03,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 3360
			},
			"text": " What if you ignored all the rules of car racing and had a contest which was simply to get"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:03,360",
				"to": "00:00:06,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 3360,
				"to": 6960
			},
			"text": " a human being around a track 200 times as fast as possible?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:06,960",
				"to": "00:00:08,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 6960,
				"to": 8540
			},
			"text": " Let's say the racer has to survive."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:08,540",
				"to": "00:00:12,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 8540,
				"to": 12180
			},
			"text": " So regardless of strategy, the best you'll be able to do is about 90 minutes."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:12,180",
				"to": "00:00:15,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 12180,
				"to": 15100
			},
			"text": " There are lots of ways you could build your vehicle, but in each case, the human is the"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:15,100",
				"to": "00:00:16,140"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 15100,
				"to": 16140
			},
			"text": " weakest part."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:16,140",
				"to": "00:00:17,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 16140,
				"to": 17820
			},
			"text": " The problem is acceleration."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:17,820",
				"to": "00:00:21,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 17820,
				"to": 21020
			},
			"text": " On the curved parts of the track, drivers will feel powerful g-forces."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,020",
				"to": "00:00:23,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21020,
				"to": 23660
			},
			"text": " Fighter pilots can experience up to 10 g's during maneuvers."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:23,660",
				"to": "00:00:26,860"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 23660,
				"to": 26860
			},
			"text": " However, fighter pilots only experience 10 g's very briefly."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:26,860",
				"to": "00:00:30,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 26860,
				"to": 30520
			},
			"text": " Our driver would be experiencing them in pulses for minutes and probably hours."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:30,520",
				"to": "00:00:34,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 30520,
				"to": 34460
			},
			"text": " There's a good NASA document on the physical effects of acceleration, and the data shows"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:34,460",
				"to": "00:00:38,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 34460,
				"to": 38240
			},
			"text": " that for periods on the order of an hour, normal humans can only handle 3 to 6 g's"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:38,240",
				"to": "00:00:39,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 38240,
				"to": 39440
			},
			"text": " of acceleration."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:39,440",
				"to": "00:00:42,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 39440,
				"to": 42900
			},
			"text": " If we limit our vehicle to 4 g's, its top speed on the turns at Daytona will be about"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:42,900",
				"to": "00:00:44,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 42900,
				"to": 44780
			},
			"text": " 240 miles per hour."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:44,780",
				"to": "00:00:47,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 44780,
				"to": 47580
			},
			"text": " At this speed, the course will take about 2 hours to complete."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:47,580",
				"to": "00:00:50,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 47580,
				"to": 50740
			},
			"text": " Keep in mind that the direction of the acceleration would keep changing depending on whether the"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:50,740",
				"to": "00:00:53,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 50740,
				"to": 53920
			},
			"text": " vehicle is going around a curve or speeding up or slowing down."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:53,920",
				"to": "00:00:57,860"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 53920,
				"to": 57860
			},
			"text": " Every direction of acceleration has its particular consequences, but humans can survive acceleration"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:57,860",
				"to": "00:01:01,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 57860,
				"to": 61300
			},
			"text": " best if they're accelerated in the direction of their chest, like a driver accelerating"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:01,300",
				"to": "00:01:02,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 61300,
				"to": 62300
			},
			"text": " forward."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:02,300",
				"to": "00:01:05,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 62300,
				"to": 65000
			},
			"text": " So to keep our driver alive, we'll need to swivel them around so they're always being"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:05,000",
				"to": "00:01:06,420"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 65000,
				"to": 66420
			},
			"text": " pressed against their back."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:06,420",
				"to": "00:01:09,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 66420,
				"to": 69780
			},
			"text": " If limited to 4 g's in this way, our driver will finish the course in a little under an"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:09,780",
				"to": "00:01:11,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 69780,
				"to": 71320
			},
			"text": " hour and 45 minutes."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:11,320",
				"to": "00:01:14,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 71320,
				"to": 74780
			},
			"text": " If we raise the limit to 6 g's, the time drops to an hour and 20 minutes."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:14,780",
				"to": "00:01:19,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 74780,
				"to": 79560
			},
			"text": " At 10 g's continuously, well past human tolerability, it would still take over an hour."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:19,560",
				"to": "00:01:23,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 79560,
				"to": 83100
			},
			"text": " So human biology limits us to Daytona finishing times over an hour."
		}
	]
}
